            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ravi Teja",
                        "email": "raviteja28031990@gmail.com",
                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "what's use of converting DHCP address as static Ipv4 address.\nwhat happens If you re-enable DHCP again, DHCP may try to assign same IP then what happens?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "rashidmp",
                        "email": "rashidmp@ami.com",
                        "username": "rashidmp2002"
                    },
                    "message": "To preserve network connectivity and prevent remote access lockout when a user disables DHCP on an interface that's currently using a DHCP-assigned IP address.\n\nThe situation when re-enabling DHCP is handled by PR https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-networkd/+/86111 , which clears static IPs before DHCP assigns new addresses."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ravi Teja",
                        "email": "raviteja28031990@gmail.com",
                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "but dhcp ip address wont be dropped until lease time expires\nit should not enter into case where same IP configured as static/DHCP origin\nplease verify with dhcp setup where dhcp address is actually assigned to BMC"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "rashidmp",
                        "email": "rashidmp@ami.com",
                        "username": "rashidmp2002"
                    },
                    "message": "Verified with DHCP setup where IP was assigned by DHCP server.\nWhen DHCPv4 is disabled, the DHCP lease is immediately released, and the DHCP-assigned IP is converted to static and persisted."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ravi Teja",
                        "email": "raviteja28031990@gmail.com",
                        "username": "raviteja-b"
                    },
                    "message": "it depends on dhcp server lease time configuration.\n@asmitk01@in.ibm.com do you want to verify this patch in your dhcp setup\nlets confirm if this behavior working as per RFCs"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "rashidmp",
                        "email": "rashidmp@ami.com",
